7	1	"[[\\"Whole Milk\\",340],[\\"Heavy Cream\\",360],[\\"Skimmed Milk Powder\\",55],[\\"Egg Yolk\\",36],[\\"Sucrose\\",85],[\\"Invert Sugar\\",12],[\\"Locust Bean Gum\\",0.8],[\\"Guar Gum\\",0.4],[\\"Lambda Carrageenan\\",0.2],[\\"Salt\\",1],[\\"Lemon Zest\\",4],[\\"Lemon Juice\\",24],[\\"Bourbon Whiskey\\",65],[\\"Angostura Aromatic Bitters\\",2],[\\"Fresh Spearmint\\",12],[\\"Peppermint Essential Oil\\",0.1]]"	[Underbelly's Bourbon Smash Ice Cream](https://under-belly.org/booze-flavored-ice-cream/) recipe,\nposted 2016-12-16, visited 2026-06-21.\n\nThe stabilizers are the 4:2:1 'Underbelly General Purpose Stabilizer Blend', total 1.4g. 'Lemon\nZest' and 'Fresh Spearmint' may only partially contribute to the composition, depending on the\npreparation, e.g. if the mint is infused rather than blended into the mix. 'Bourbon' is listed as\n43%, which Sci-Cream's 'Bourbon Whiskey' matches, but other bourbons can range from 40-45% ABV; one\ncan substitute in 'X% ABV Spirit' to match the specific bourbon used. The recipe states "very fresh\nmint leaves" and "mint essential oil" without specifying a variety - spearmint is commonly used in\ncocktails, and peppermint essential oil is most common.	\N	\N	\N	2026-11-23 01:49:33.684775	\N
