Soy Lecithin Powder	1	Emulsifier	"{\\"name\\":\\"Soy Lecithin Powder\\",\\"category\\":\\"Emulsifier\\",\\"EmulsifierSpec\\":{\\"emulsifiers\\":{\\"lecithin\\":95},\\"other_solids\\":{\\"fats\\":{\\"total\\":5}}},\\"comments\\":\\"De-oiled soy lecithin powder with a purity (acetone insoluble substances) of ~95%; the remaining\\\\nsubstances are mostly triglycerides (EFSA et al., 2017, 3.1.1 Identity of the substance)[^75], (East\\\\nHarbour Group, 2026, \\\\\\"Lecithin, Technical Specification\\\\\\")[^522].\\\\n\\\\n[^75]: EFSA Panel on Food Additives and Nutrient Sources added to Food (ANS), et al. (2017, April). [_Re-evaluation of lecithins (E 322) as a food additive_](https://doi.org/10.2903/j.efsa.2017.4742). EFSA Journal, 15(4), e04742.\\\\n[^522]: [_Lecithin, Technical Specification TDS-145-V2_](https://www.eastharbourgroup.com/storage/download-files/lecithin/Lecithin-TDS-145-V2.pdf). (2026). East Harbour Group.\\"}"
